2> Detecting: [PREFIX]/share/sourcemeta/one/self/v1/schemas/mcp/tools/call/trace-schema-evaluation/request.json (#28)
2> Detecting: [PREFIX]/share/sourcemeta/one/self/v1/schemas/mcp/tools/call/trace-schema-evaluation/response.json (#29)
2> Detecting: [PREFIX]/share/sourcemeta/one/self/v1/schemas/mcp/tools/call/get-schema-metadata/request.json (#30)
2> Detecting: [PREFIX]/share/sourcemeta/one/self/v1/schemas/mcp/tools/call/get-schema-metadata/response.json (#31)
2> Detecting: [PREFIX]/share/sourcemeta/one/self/v1/schemas/mcp/tools/list/request.json (#32)
2> Detecting: [PREFIX]/share/sourcemeta/one/self/v1/schemas/mcp/tools/list/response.json (#33)
2> Detecting: [PREFIX]/share/sourcemeta/one/self/v1/schemas/mcp/initialize/request.json (#34)
