2> Detecting: [PREFIX]/share/sourcemeta/one/self/v1/schemas/mcp/resources/read/request.json (#36)
2> Detecting: [PREFIX]/share/sourcemeta/one/self/v1/schemas/mcp/resources/read/response.json (#37)
2> Detecting: [PREFIX]/share/sourcemeta/one/self/v1/schemas/mcp/resources/list/request.json (#38)
2> Detecting: [PREFIX]/share/sourcemeta/one/self/v1/schemas/mcp/resources/list/response.json (#39)
2> Detecting: [PREFIX]/share/sourcemeta/one/self/v1/schemas/mcp/resources/templates/list/request.json (#40)
2> Detecting: [PREFIX]/share/sourcemeta/one/self/v1/schemas/mcp/resources/templates/list/response.json (#41)
2> Detecting: [PREFIX]/share/sourcemeta/one/self/v1/schemas/mcp/prm/response.json (#42)
