2> Detecting: [PREFIX]/share/sourcemeta/one/self/v1/schemas/api/error.json (#46)
2> Detecting: [PREFIX]/share/sourcemeta/one/self/v1/schemas/api/auth/login/response.json (#47)
2> Detecting: [PREFIX]/share/sourcemeta/one/self/v1/schemas/api/schemas/trace/request.json (#48)
2> Detecting: [PREFIX]/share/sourcemeta/one/self/v1/schemas/api/schemas/trace/response.json (#49)
2> Detecting: [PREFIX]/share/sourcemeta/one/self/v1/schemas/api/schemas/health/response.json (#50)
2> Detecting: [PREFIX]/share/sourcemeta/one/self/v1/schemas/api/schemas/dependents/response.json (#51)
2> Detecting: [PREFIX]/share/sourcemeta/one/self/v1/schemas/api/schemas/dependencies/response.json (#52)
2> Detecting: [PREFIX]/share/sourcemeta/one/self/v1/schemas/api/schemas/position.json (#53)
2> Detecting: [PREFIX]/share/sourcemeta/one/self/v1/schemas/api/schemas/search/response.json (#54)
